From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Adeeb Shihadeh <adeeb@comma.ai>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 04:50:54 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: arm: qcom: add the comma four and comma 3X

The comma four ("mici") and comma 3X ("tizi") are driver assistance
devices built around the SDM845. Add their board compatibles, which
their device trees use together with qcom,sdm845.

Signed-off-by: Adeeb Shihadeh <adeeb@comma.ai>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml
index ff8a35df78..166f83d108 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml
@@ -960,6 +960,8 @@ properties:
 
       - items:
           - enum:
+              - comma,mici
+              - comma,tizi
               - google,blueline
               - google,crosshatch
               - huawei,planck
